{"ID":"20240314091927-7rjljwc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091927-7rjljwc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091927-7rjljwc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164629-gnmgtcw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164629-8c43vrc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422164629-8c43vrc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【大黄硝石汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422164629-gnmgtcw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-gnmgtcw","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄疸，腹满，小便不利而赤，自汗出，此为表和里实，当下之，宜大黄硝石汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-wbffglj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-wbffglj","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄硝石汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-j9px4n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-j9px4n5","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄、黄柏、硝石各四两，栀子十五枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-nccvgms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-nccvgms","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水六升，煮取二升，去滓，内硝，更煮取一升，顿服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-vp6nahk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-vp6nahk","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来诸位看。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄疸，腹满。小便不利而赤，自汗出，此为表和里实，当下之，宜大黄硝石汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-bh8kkpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-bh8kkpm","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄柏，茵陈，栀子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有一味"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柏子仁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这几味药呢诸位一定要非常了解它的药性，这样子的话，任何的肝病你都会治疗。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-cbx9wyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-cbx9wyb","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茵陈，我前面已经讲过，你不要管寒热，都能去黄，所以你只要看到病人有黄，都可以用茵陈"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"栀子呢是肝胆的湿热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为湿热，栀子的性是比较寒的，茵陈呢去黄，同时呢能去湿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄柏呢这个药专门治膀胱不利，小便排不出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，膀胱发炎，黄柏哦；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芩呢是治胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，像我们的泻心汤里面，很多地方用到黄芩，胃里面发炎的时候我们都会用到黄芩，讲到胃就是胃和十二指肠这一带哦；那仁剂柏子仁，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柏子仁是这里呢仁剂通利大便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以当你下手治疗他的时候病人很虚，便秘又不是很严重，那你说老师我用大黄下去可能太强了，我用滋润的方法把它导出来；就好像酒客病，酒客病的话你一直在攻它一直在攻它，结果它变成黑疸哦，那柏子仁就可以用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柏子仁是肝胆方面很好的润肠剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-hqgci3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-hqgci3m","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那当你会使用这几味药的药性以后，我们现在举例了，有一个人来呢，胆结石，老师，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道他胆结石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"？第一个，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"右上腹，上腹胁肋这里面痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；第二个胆结石痛很好玩，它会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痛到后面去，还有痛到肩膀上"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，从这边（上腹）放射状的痛到肩膀上，然后你再查阳陵泉下一寸的地方"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆石点有压痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；然后呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳朵的胆囊点也可以查到有压痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-hqeks39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-hqeks39","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那胆结石我们如何不开刀，怎么治疗？中医呢，我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般用的是四逆散的加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三钱，黄芩消炎，黄芩三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那四逆散呢我们会用到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对不对？枳实就是食物的溲水用它，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一般四逆散，然后我们化消胆结石的时候，我们一定用两味药，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五倍子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"海金砂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；这个治跟我们那个什么肾结石处方不太一样。那五倍子呢，它长的样子就像一个袋子，就是一些螳螂呀一些昆虫类东西吐出来的口水，结成一个...以后到我诊所可以看到，结在树上面的，那树长在这边，它就结在树枝这边，这就是五倍子，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"很像胆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如说这是树枝树叶，五倍子就结在（树枝和树叶间）这个地方，那我们知道五倍子酸，是不是入肝胆？我们知道五倍子可以把胆膨得像一个气球一样，那我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五倍子入药之前呢用黑醋炒过"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为你醋一炒过酸嘛，酸味入肝胆，一下就把石头清出来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-caswbjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-caswbjf","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那有一种情形呢，刚刚我们刘医师提醒我们，它总胆管呢，像石头比较小的时候，一般他们西医呢把胆拿掉，胆拿掉时候胆囊还是有胆汁到这边来（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪师应该指的是胆道"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这种状况有没遇到过？有遇到过。我有一个病人呢，就是我在网络上写你只能活两次那个病人，他在20 岁的时候出了车祸，就是他骑摩托车很疯呀，骑摩托车在山上山坡上面跳来跳去，结果不幸摩托车飞起来向大树撞上去，撞上去以后他脾脏也破裂了，胆也破裂了，意外车祸，当时呢就把他脾脏拿掉，胆也拿掉。这40 年以后呢，肝硬化，他两次肚子腹水肿大，我把他救回来，他就是胆没有。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-3iy5zgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-3iy5zgs","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以如果这个胆道还是通的，当然有的时候他整个胆都把它切掉了，只有总胆管在这边，有时候你没有胆了但胆道还是通的，那以后会不会还是会有问题啊？这个也就是个案例。他大便都很好啊，但是还是一样，所以如果说有胆囊在这边，有个袋子在这边，可能一定有它的功能在那边，那比如说有个袋子，胆汁喷下来停留在这袋子里面，对不对？需要用的时候慢慢喷射出来，不会说一直从肝里面直接喷到十二指肠去，起到缓冲的作用，有缓冲作用很好啊，当你有咀嚼食物有食物消化的时候它就排出来，没有的话它速度会减慢下来，顺着你的身体来调整，所以一定有它的功能在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-p3x5y6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-p3x5y6k","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们处理胆结石的处方一般就是这样。那很痛的时候，下针，针一下去，像你下...胆募"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"日月"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胆的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆俞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，背后的胆俞，那我们治疗胆的话一定会下胆经上面的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆结石点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，都可以下针。，"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-qonkgwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-qonkgwu","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里呢，如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腹满，小便不利而赤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，腹满肚子里面都是湿啊，小便又出不来，病人又"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自汗出，此为表和里实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大便堵到了，这都是热证嘛，小便颜色非常的深。我们在治疗里实的时候，如果肠胃里面结石，这里呢讲得是热，里面一结石有热的时候小便颜色会比较深，那你把它清出来后，那你说老师吃药吃到什么时候？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃到小便颜色变成淡黄，就好了，然后腹也不满了，黄也没了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-hjp7y8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-hjp7y8q","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胆发病很好玩哦，晚上十一点到一点，这二个小时呢，子时，胆流注的时间，所以一般胆 11：30，12 点钟突然发病。所以我常常笑老外啊，这个如果真的有 vampire，vampire 就是美国人讲吸血鬼呀，你把他胆拿掉，因为 vampire 都是 12 点钟醒过来的嘛，那个 glandpa 那个钟敲 12点时，你把胆拿掉，胆结石拿掉，它就不会醒过来哦，很准时，所以这个 vampire这个吸血鬼一定有胆结石，可能很大，很准时的醒过来。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-wjr9bg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-wjr9bg3","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个呢，是因为它整个堵在肠子里面，你看它的处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄和芒硝大家都知道了，这个是攻坚，会用到芒硝就是里面大便变成干燥的燥矢在里面了，会用到栀子代表是肝胆的湿热，会用到黄柏代表膀胱里面，小便里面哦有发炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以说这种黄疸的腹满呢都在下焦的地方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便不利而赤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般来说都会有痛，赤是红色而且会有痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小便你只要不顺畅，尿道有发炎，膀胱有发炎，都可以使用黄柏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那大黄跟（芒硝），（大黄）这个是去实，（芒硝）这是打散掉，那这四味药呢，用六碗水煮二碗就可以吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-x9dy3kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-x9dy3kp","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以说这个处方看了以后，大家一定会了解到这个是遇到肝胆的湿热，还有膀胱的湿热通通可以使用它。比如说有一个人来找你，哎哟，我这个大便排不出来，几天没出来？一个礼拜没出来，（你问）你有没有放屁呀？我屁都不放一个，大便燥屎堵到了嘛，屁都没有一个，小便什么颜色了？黄色，这个很黄哦，这个看起来像大承气汤，他说医生呀，我小便不出来，大承气汤小便还是出来的，小便排不出来我们知道是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膀胱的结热，结石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，也是这个处方（大黄硝石汤），还有是肝胆的结石，湿热，也是这种处方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-isbgmmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-isbgmmn","updated":"20240422164629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大家要知道栀子的功能，就知道什么时候我们需要使用栀子。"}]},{"ID":"20240422164629-8c43vrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422164629-8c43vrc","updated":"20240422164629"}}]}